	hristen our monthly lecture series\, “Wheelhouse Wednesday.” Our guest for
	 this inaugural lecture will be Darren Shelton\, Vice President at Moran S
	hipping and HMCM Board member\, presenting “Freedom Needed A Harbor: Celeb
	rating 250 Years of American Freedom Through the Story of the Houston Ship
	 Channel.” \nTickets are $5\n\nhttps://houstonmaritime.org/event/wheelhous
	e-wednesday-freedom-needed-a-harbor/\n\nFrom Houston Maritime Museum
